Third-party code included in this repository
=============================================

src/rbf_sbi/bnn.py contains two functions derived from sklearn-contrib-bde 1.0.2
(https://github.com/scikit-learn-contrib/bde): CorrelatedBdeRegressor.fit (from Bde._fit) and
_fit_members_explicit_split (from BdeBuilder.fit_members). They are distributed under the bde license below.

The figure paper/figures/project_summary/mile/sommer2025_fig1_mile_flowchart.pdf is reproduced from
Sommer et al., Microcanonical Langevin Ensembles (ICLR 2025), Fig. 1, under CC BY 4.0.

